    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Cats in Ellara</strong> is a charming hidden object game where you explore a carefully crafted, hand-drawn isometric world in search of 100 hidden cats. With its cozy atmosphere and peaceful soundtrack, immerse yourself in a relaxing experience as you uncover each cat tucked away in the detailed environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Progress:</strong> Automatically saves, so you can continue anytime.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Movement</strong>: Use <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> or the <strong>arrow keys</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pan</strong>: Click and hold the <strong>left mouse button</strong>, then drag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edge Panning</strong>: Move the cursor to the screen edges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom</strong>: Adjust with the scroll wheel</p></li></ul>",
